        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Irving Cummings, Irving Camisky, Dennis Gansel, William M. Conselman, Karoline Herfurth, Nina Hoss\n- Films: I Believed in You, We Are the Night\n- Roles: actor, director, producer, writer\n- Topics: American film, German film, drama film, vampire horror film\n\nFacts:\n- Irving Camisky, known as Irving Cummings, was born on October 9, 1888, and became an American movie actor, director, producer, and writer.\n- I Believed in You is a 1934 American drama film directed by Irving Cummings and written by William M. Conselman.\n- Dennis Gansel was born on October 4, 1973, and is a German film director, writer, and actor.\n- We Are the Night is a 2010 German vampire horror film directed by Dennis Gansel and starring Karoline Herfurth and Nina Hoss.",
